sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Peer A
    participant S as Signaling<br/>(server / in-memory)
    participant STUN as STUN Server
    participant B as Peer B

    Note over A,B: ── Step 1: Offer ──────────────────────

    A->>A: createDataChannel("notepad")
    A->>A: createOffer() → SDP Offer
    A->>A: setLocalDescription(offer)
    A->>S: send SDP Offer
    S->>B: relay SDP Offer

    Note over A,B: ── Step 2: Answer ─────────────────────

    B->>B: setRemoteDescription(offer)
    B->>B: createAnswer() → SDP Answer
    B->>B: setLocalDescription(answer)
    B->>S: send SDP Answer
    S->>A: relay SDP Answer
    A->>A: setRemoteDescription(answer)

    Note over A,B: ── Step 3: ICE Exchange ───────────────

    A->>STUN: What is my public IP?
    STUN-->>A: Your IP:port
    A->>S: ICE candidate (A)
    S->>B: relay ICE candidate
    B->>B: addIceCandidate()

    B->>STUN: What is my public IP?
    STUN-->>B: Your IP:port
    B->>S: ICE candidate (B)
    S->>A: relay ICE candidate
    A->>A: addIceCandidate()

    Note over A,B: ── Step 4: Direct P2P ─────────────────

    A-->>B: DataChannel OPEN (no server)
    B-->>A: DataChannel OPEN (no server)

    Note over A,B: ── Syncing ────────────────────────────

    A->>B: dc.send(text) — direct, real-time
    B->>A: dc.send(text) — direct, real-time
